<title>UK: ZENECA TO MEET UNDERLYING GROWTH TARGET.</title>
<headline>ZENECA TO MEET UNDERLYING GROWTH TARGET.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceuticals and chemicals company Zeneca Group Plc said on Thursday that underlying profit growth for the year &quot;should be broadly in line with our aspirational target of 15 percent per annum.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said the current level of sterling would continue to have an adverse impact on the second half performance, with higher fixed costs expected from the launch of further new products.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
